    ")\n",
    "\n",
    "print(f\"Region: {REGION}\")\n",
    "print(f\"Foundation Model (Agent): {MODEL_IDS['claude_haiku']}\")\n",
    "print(\"控制面客户端：\", bedrock_agent().__class__.__name__)\n",
    "print(\"数据面客户端：\", bedrock_agent_runtime().__class__.__name__)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "5f28fce8",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "### 配置参数（**请按实际环境填写**）\n",
    "\n",
    "> 💡 **强烈推荐**：Agent / Action Group / Lambda 等首次创建走 **Bedrock 控制台向导**——可视化、报错友好。本 Notebook 提供 boto3 代码作为参考与自动化模板。"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "c52210fa",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# TODO: 填写已存在的 Knowledge Base ID（Lab 1 / Lab 6 创建过）\n",
    "KB_ID = \"YOUR_KB_ID\"\n",
    "\n",
    "# TODO: 填写 Agent 执行角色 ARN（需可调 Bedrock + Lambda + KB）\n",
    "AGENT_ROLE_ARN = \"arn:aws:iam::123456789012:role/AmazonBedrockExecutionRoleForAgents_xxx\"\n",
    "\n",
    "# TODO: 填写两个预部署 Lambda 的 ARN\n",
    "LAMBDA_ORDER_ARN    = \"arn:aws:lambda:us-east-1:123456789012:function:lab10-get-order-status\"\n",
    "LAMBDA_SHIPMENT_ARN = \"arn:aws:lambda:us-east-1:123456789012:function:lab10-track-shipment\"\n",
    "\n",
    "# TODO: Agent 名称（不要与已有 Agent 重名）\n",
    "AGENT_NAME = \"lab10-customer-service-agent\"\n",
    "\n",
    "# TODO: 选用的底层模型（建议 Haiku，便宜延迟低；复杂场景可换 Sonnet）\n",
