    "\n",
    "print(\"参数加载完成（请确认 TODO 已填）\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "34d1b32c",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 3. 步骤 1 · 设计 Agent 指令（最有价值的一步）\n",
    "\n",
    "**Instruction = Agent 的灵魂**。推荐 4 段式：\n",
    "1. **角色**：你是谁\n",
    "2. **能力**：你能做什么（工具列表）\n",
    "3. **判断规则**（关键）：什么场景调什么工具\n",
    "4. **兜底**：信息不足要追问，敏感操作要确认\n",
    "\n",
    "下面这段 Instruction 是参考版。学员可以先自己写一版，再对比。"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "6771d9fd",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "AGENT_INSTRUCTION = \"\"\"你是一家跨境电商的客服助手，名叫小 A。你的任务是用专业、友好、简洁的中文回答用户问题。\n",
    "\n",
    "你拥有以下能力：\n",
    "1. 查询常见问答（FAQ）：退货政策、配送时效、会员权益等——通过关联的 Knowledge Base 检索\n",
    "2. 查询订单状态：通过 getOrderStatus 工具，需要订单号\n",
    "3. 查询物流轨迹：通过 trackShipment 工具，需要订单号\n",
    "\n",
    "判断规则（务必遵守）：\n",
    "- 用户问政策、流程、通用问题（如\"几天到货\"、\"怎么退货\"） → 用 Knowledge Base 检索\n",
    "- 用户问具体某笔订单的状态、金额 → 调 getOrderStatus（必须先要到订单号）\n",
    "- 用户问\"我的包裹到哪了\"、\"快递怎么走的\" → 调 trackShipment\n",
    "- 退货/退款类需求 → 先调 getOrderStatus 验证订单是否可退（已发货且 7 天内），\n",
    "  再用 KB 检索退货政策细则，最后给出明确的下一步指引\n",
    "\n",
    "兜底原则：\n",
    "- 用户没提供订单号时，礼貌追问，不要编造订单号\n",
    "- 检索 / API 都没有结果时，明确告知\"暂无相关信息\"，并建议联系人工客服\n",
    "- 涉及金额、退款、修改地址等敏感操作时，先复述给用户确认\n",
    "\"\"\"\n",
    "\n",
    "print(AGENT_INSTRUCTION)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "813fd934",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 4. 步骤 2 · Lambda 函数定义（参考代码）\n",
    "\n",
    "下面给出两个 Action Group Lambda 的**参考实现**，便于学员理解 Agent ↔ Lambda 的契约。  \n",
    "讲师已预部署 Lambda，本 Notebook 仅在需要复习时阅读这段代码。"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "8bc31b98",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# ============================================================\n",
    "# 参考代码 1：getOrderStatus Lambda（订单查询）\n",
    "# ============================================================\n",
    "ORDER_LAMBDA_REFERENCE = '''\n",
    "import json\n",
    "\n",
    "# 模拟数据：真实场景应查询订单系统 / DynamoDB\n",
    "MOCK_ORDERS = {\n",
    "    \"88321\": {\"status\": \"shipped\", \"ship_date\": \"2026-06-09\",\n",
    "              \"amount\": 1299.0, \"currency\": \"CNY\", \"sku\": \"WH-1000XM5\"},\n",
    "    \"88322\": {\"status\": \"delivered\", \"ship_date\": \"2026-06-01\",\n",
    "              \"amount\": 459.0, \"currency\": \"CNY\", \"sku\": \"AIRPODS-PRO\"},\n",
    "    \"88323\": {\"status\": \"processing\", \"ship_date\": None,\n",
    "              \"amount\": 89.0, \"currency\": \"CNY\", \"sku\": \"USB-C-CABLE\"},\n",
    "}\n",
    "\n",
    "def lambda_handler(event, context):\n",
    "    # Bedrock Agent 注入的事件结构\n",
    "    action_group = event[\"actionGroup\"]\n",
    "    api_path     = event.get(\"apiPath\", \"\")\n",
    "    parameters   = {p[\"name\"]: p[\"value\"] for p in event.get(\"parameters\", [])}\n",
    "    order_id     = parameters.get(\"order_id\", \"\").lstrip(\"#\")\n",
    "\n",
    "    if order_id in MOCK_ORDERS:\n",
    "        body = {\"order_id\": order_id, **MOCK_ORDERS[order_id]}\n",
    "    else:\n",
    "        body = {\"error\": \"order_not_found\", \"order_id\": order_id}\n",
    "\n",
    "    return {\n",
    "        \"messageVersion\": \"1.0\",\n",
    "        \"response\": {\n",
    "            \"actionGroup\": action_group,\n",
    "            \"apiPath\": api_path,\n",
    "            \"httpMethod\": event.get(\"httpMethod\", \"GET\"),\n",
    "            \"httpStatusCode\": 200,\n",
    "            \"responseBody\": {\"application/json\": {\"body\": json.dumps(body)}}\n",
    "        }\n",
    "    }\n",
    "'''\n",
    "print(ORDER_LAMBDA_REFERENCE)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "4d286e39",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# ============================================================\n",
    "# 参考代码 2：trackShipment Lambda（物流查询）\n",
    "# ============================================================\n",
    "SHIPMENT_LAMBDA_REFERENCE = '''\n",
    "import json\n",
    "\n",
    "MOCK_SHIPMENTS = {\n",
    "    \"88321\": {\"carrier\": \"SF\", \"tracking_no\": \"SF1234567890\",\n",
    "              \"current_location\": \"东京清关中心\",\n",
    "              \"eta\": \"2026-06-13\",\n",
    "              \"events\": [\n",
    "                  {\"time\": \"2026-06-09 10:00\", \"desc\": \"已揽收\"},\n",
    "                  {\"time\": \"2026-06-10 22:00\", \"desc\": \"已发往日本\"},\n",
    "                  {\"time\": \"2026-06-12 09:00\", \"desc\": \"到达东京清关中心\"}\n",
    "              ]},\n",
    "    \"88322\": {\"carrier\": \"DHL\", \"tracking_no\": \"DHL9876543210\",\n",
    "              \"current_location\": \"已签收\",\n",
    "              \"eta\": \"2026-06-01\",\n",
    "              \"events\": [{\"time\": \"2026-06-01 15:00\", \"desc\": \"用户已签收\"}]},\n",
    "}\n",
    "\n",
    "def lambda_handler(event, context):\n",
    "    action_group = event[\"actionGroup\"]\n",
    "    api_path     = event.get(\"apiPath\", \"\")\n",
    "    parameters   = {p[\"name\"]: p[\"value\"] for p in event.get(\"parameters\", [])}\n",
    "    order_id     = parameters.get(\"order_id\", \"\").lstrip(\"#\")\n",
    "\n",
    "    if order_id in MOCK_SHIPMENTS:\n",
    "        body = {\"order_id\": order_id, **MOCK_SHIPMENTS[order_id]}\n",
    "    else:\n",
    "        body = {\"error\": \"shipment_not_found\", \"order_id\": order_id}\n",
    "\n",
    "    return {\n",
    "        \"messageVersion\": \"1.0\",\n",
    "        \"response\": {\n",
    "            \"actionGroup\": action_group,\n",
    "            \"apiPath\": api_path,\n",
    "            \"httpMethod\": event.get(\"httpMethod\", \"GET\"),\n",
    "            \"httpStatusCode\": 200,\n",
    "            \"responseBody\": {\"application/json\": {\"body\": json.dumps(body)}}\n",
    "        }\n",
    "    }\n",
    "'''\n",
    "print(SHIPMENT_LAMBDA_REFERENCE)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "009eef09",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 5. 步骤 3 · Action Group 的 OpenAPI Schema\n",
    "\n",
    "**关键认知**：Agent 看不到代码，它只看 schema 描述。`description` 字段 = Agent 的决策依据。"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "5c6a045a",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "ORDER_API_SCHEMA = {\n",
    "    \"openapi\": \"3.0.0\",\n",
    "    \"info\": {\"title\": \"Order Service API\", \"version\": \"1.0.0\"},\n",
    "    \"paths\": {\n",
    "        \"/getOrderStatus\": {\n",
    "            \"get\": {\n",
    "                \"operationId\": \"getOrderStatus\",\n",
    "                \"summary\": \"查询订单当前状态、金额、商品 SKU\",\n",
    "                \"description\": (\n",
    "                    \"根据订单号查询订单的当前状态（processing / shipped / delivered）、\"\n",
    "                    \"发货时间、金额、商品 SKU。当用户问『我的订单怎么样』『订单 #xxx 多少钱』\"\n",
    "                    \"或退货前需要先验证订单是否可退时，调用此工具。\"\n",
    "                ),\n",
    "                \"parameters\": [{\n",
    "                    \"name\": \"order_id\", \"in\": \"query\", \"required\": True,\n",
    "                    \"description\": \"用户的订单号，纯数字（如 88321），不要带 # 符号\",\n",
    "                    \"schema\": {\"type\": \"string\"}\n",
    "                }],\n",
    "                \"responses\": {\"200\": {\"description\": \"订单详情 JSON\"}}\n",
    "            }\n",
    "        }\n",
    "    }\n",
    "}\n",
    "\n",
    "SHIPMENT_API_SCHEMA = {\n",
    "    \"openapi\": \"3.0.0\",\n",
    "    \"info\": {\"title\": \"Shipment Service API\", \"version\": \"1.0.0\"},\n",
    "    \"paths\": {\n",
    "        \"/trackShipment\": {\n",
    "            \"get\": {\n",
    "                \"operationId\": \"trackShipment\",\n",
    "                \"summary\": \"查询订单的物流轨迹与预计送达时间\",\n",
    "                \"description\": (\n",
    "                    \"根据订单号查询其物流当前位置、承运商、预计送达时间、历史轨迹事件。\"\n",
    "                    \"当用户问『我的快递到哪了』『包裹什么时候到』时调用。\"\n",
    "                ),\n",
    "                \"parameters\": [{\n",
    "                    \"name\": \"order_id\", \"in\": \"query\", \"required\": True,\n",
    "                    \"description\": \"用户的订单号，纯数字\",\n",
    "                    \"schema\": {\"type\": \"string\"}\n",
    "                }],\n",
    "                \"responses\": {\"200\": {\"description\": \"物流轨迹 JSON\"}}\n",
    "            }\n",
    "        }\n",
    "    }\n",
    "}\n",
    "\n",
    "print(\"OrderAPI operations:\", list(ORDER_API_SCHEMA[\"paths\"].keys()))\n",
    "print(\"ShipmentAPI operations:\", list(SHIPMENT_API_SCHEMA[\"paths\"].keys()))"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "f0d83064",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 6. 步骤 4 · 用 boto3 创建 Agent（参考代码 / 推荐控制台）\n",
    "\n",
    "> ⚠️ **首次创建强烈推荐 Bedrock 控制台向导**：可视化、报错友好、自动配置 IAM。  \n",
    "> 下面 boto3 代码用于自动化（CI/CD、批量重建）或学员复习用。\n",
    "\n",
    "**步骤拆解**：\n",
    "1. `create_agent`：创建 Agent 主体\n",
    "2. `create_agent_action_group` × 2：分别挂订单查询、物流查询\n",
    "3. `associate_agent_knowledge_base`：挂 FAQ 知识库\n",
    "4. `prepare_agent`：编译生效\n",
    "5. `create_agent_alias`：创建可调用别名"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "c5c94da7",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "ba = bedrock_agent()\n",
    "\n",
    "def create_lab10_agent():\n",
    "    \"\"\"参考实现：从零创建 Lab 10 的客服 Agent。返回 (agent_id, alias_id)。\n",
    "    生产场景请加 try/except 与幂等检查。\"\"\"\n",
    "\n",
    "    # ---- (1) 创建 Agent 主体 ----\n",
    "    resp = ba.create_agent(\n",
    "        agentName=AGENT_NAME,\n",
    "        agentResourceRoleArn=AGENT_ROLE_ARN,\n",
    "        foundationModel=AGENT_FOUNDATION_MODEL,\n",
    "        instruction=AGENT_INSTRUCTION,\n",
    "        idleSessionTTLInSeconds=600,\n",
    "        description=\"Lab 10 跨境电商客服 Agent（FAQ + 订单 + 物流）\",\n",
    "    )\n",
    "    agent_id = resp[\"agent\"][\"agentId\"]\n",
    "    print(f\"agent created: {agent_id}\")\n",
    "    time.sleep(5)  # 等待 NOT_PREPARED 状态稳定\n",
    "\n",
    "    # ---- (2) 创建 Action Group：订单查询 ----\n",
    "    ba.create_agent_action_group(\n",
    "        agentId=agent_id,\n",
    "        agentVersion=\"DRAFT\",\n",
    "        actionGroupName=\"order-actions\",\n",
    "        actionGroupExecutor={\"lambda\": LAMBDA_ORDER_ARN},\n",
    "        apiSchema={\"payload\": json.dumps(ORDER_API_SCHEMA)},\n",
    "        description=\"订单状态查询\",\n",
    "    )\n",
    "    print(\"action group [order-actions] attached\")\n",
    "\n",
    "    # ---- (3) 创建 Action Group：物流查询 ----\n",
    "    ba.create_agent_action_group(\n",
    "        agentId=agent_id,\n",
    "        agentVersion=\"DRAFT\",\n",
    "        actionGroupName=\"shipment-actions\",\n",
    "        actionGroupExecutor={\"lambda\": LAMBDA_SHIPMENT_ARN},\n",
    "        apiSchema={\"payload\": json.dumps(SHIPMENT_API_SCHEMA)},\n",
    "        description=\"物流轨迹查询\",\n",
    "    )\n",
    "    print(\"action group [shipment-actions] attached\")\n",
    "\n",
    "    # ---- (4) 关联 Knowledge Base（FAQ） ----\n",
    "    ba.associate_agent_knowledge_base(\n",
    "        agentId=agent_id,\n",
    "        agentVersion=\"DRAFT\",\n",
    "        knowledgeBaseId=KB_ID,\n",
    "        description=(\n",
    "            \"客服 FAQ 知识库：退货政策、配送时效、会员等。\"\n",
    "            \"用户问通用问题、政策、流程时检索此 KB。\"\n",
    "        ),\n",
    "        knowledgeBaseState=\"ENABLED\",\n",
    "    )\n",
    "    print(f\"kb associated: {KB_ID}\")\n",
    "\n",
    "    # ---- (5) Prepare Agent（编译） ----\n",
    "    ba.prepare_agent(agentId=agent_id)\n",
    "    print(\"prepare_agent triggered, polling status...\")\n",
    "    for _ in range(30):\n",
    "        st = ba.get_agent(agentId=agent_id)[\"agent\"][\"agentStatus\"]\n",
    "        print(f\"  status={st}\")\n",
    "        if st == \"PREPARED\":\n",
    "            break\n",
    "        time.sleep(5)\n",
    "\n",
    "    # ---- (6) 创建 Alias ----\n",
    "    alias = ba.create_agent_alias(\n",
    "        agentId=agent_id, agentAliasName=\"live\",\n",
    "        description=\"Lab 10 调用别名\",\n",
    "    )\n",
    "    alias_id = alias[\"agentAlias\"][\"agentAliasId\"]\n",
    "    print(f\"alias created: {alias_id}\")\n",
    "    return agent_id, alias_id\n",
    "\n",
    "# 取消下行注释执行（讲师演示时可控制台同步演示）\n",
    "# AGENT_ID, AGENT_ALIAS_ID = create_lab10_agent()"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "22a110d8",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# TODO: 如果你已经在控制台/上面 cell 创建过 Agent，把 ID 填到这里\n",
    "AGENT_ID = \"YOUR_AGENT_ID\"\n",
    "AGENT_ALIAS_ID = \"YOUR_ALIAS_ID\"  # 例如 'TSTALIASID' 或刚才创建的 alias\n",
    "\n",
    "print(f\"Will invoke: agent={AGENT_ID} alias={AGENT_ALIAS_ID}\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "b75be983",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 7. 步骤 5 · 调用 Agent + 抓 Trace（核心动手）\n",
    "\n",
    "我们封装一个 `invoke_agent_with_trace` 函数，执行后返回 `(answer, trace_events)`。"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "769795bb",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "import uuid\n",
    "\n",
    "def invoke_agent_with_trace(question: str, *, session_id: str | None = None,\n",
    "                            agent_id: str = AGENT_ID,\n",
    "                            alias_id: str = AGENT_ALIAS_ID) -> tuple[str, list]:\n",
    "    \"\"\"调用 Agent 并收集 Trace 事件。\n",
    "    返回：(最终回答文本, trace 列表)\n",
    "    \"\"\"\n",
    "    rt = bedrock_agent_runtime()\n",
    "    sid = session_id or f\"lab10-{uuid.uuid4().hex[:8]}\"\n",
    "\n",
    "    resp = rt.invoke_agent(\n",
    "        agentId=agent_id,\n",
    "        agentAliasId=alias_id,\n",
    "        sessionId=sid,\n",
    "        inputText=question,\n",
    "        enableTrace=True,  # ⭐ 关键：必须打开\n",
    "    )\n",
    "\n",
    "    answer_chunks: list[str] = []\n",
    "    trace_events: list[dict] = []\n",
    "    for event in resp[\"completion\"]:\n",
    "        if \"chunk\" in event:\n",
    "            data = event[\"chunk\"].get(\"bytes\")\n",
    "            if data:\n",
    "                answer_chunks.append(data.decode(\"utf-8\"))\n",
    "        if \"trace\" in event:\n",
    "            trace_events.append(event[\"trace\"])\n",
    "    return \"\".join(answer_chunks), trace_events\n",
    "\n",
    "print(\"helper ready\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "6f89662c",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "def summarize_trace(trace_events: list[dict]) -> None:\n",
    "    \"\"\"把 Trace 中的关键节点（Rationale / Invocation / Observation / Final）打印出来。\"\"\"\n",
    "    if not trace_events:\n",
    "        print(\"(no trace; 检查 enableTrace 是否为 True)\")\n",
    "        return\n",
    "    for i, ev in enumerate(trace_events, 1):\n",
    "        t = ev.get(\"trace\", {})\n",
    "        orch = t.get(\"orchestrationTrace\", {})\n",
    "        if \"rationale\" in orch:\n",
    "            print(f\"[#{i}] 🟡 Rationale → {orch['rationale'].get('text','')[:300]}\")\n",
    "        if \"invocationInput\" in orch:\n",
    "            ii = orch[\"invocationInput\"]\n",
    "            if \"actionGroupInvocationInput\" in ii:\n",
    "                a = ii[\"actionGroupInvocationInput\"]\n",
    "                params = a.get(\"parameters\") or a.get(\"requestBody\")\n",
    "                print(f\"[#{i}] 🔵 InvokeAction → {a.get('actionGroupName')} \"\n",
    "                      f\"op={a.get('apiPath') or a.get('function')} params={params}\")\n",
    "            elif \"knowledgeBaseLookupInput\" in ii:\n",
    "                k = ii[\"knowledgeBaseLookupInput\"]\n",
    "                print(f\"[#{i}] 🔵 KB-Lookup → q={k.get('text','')[:200]}\")\n",
    "        if \"observation\" in orch:\n",
    "            obs = orch[\"observation\"]\n",
    "            if \"actionGroupInvocationOutput\" in obs:\n",
    "                o = obs[\"actionGroupInvocationOutput\"].get(\"text\", \"\")\n",
    "                print(f\"[#{i}] 🟢 Observation(API) → {o[:300]}\")\n",
    "            elif \"knowledgeBaseLookupOutput\" in obs:\n",
    "                refs = obs[\"knowledgeBaseLookupOutput\"].get(\"retrievedReferences\", [])\n",
    "                print(f\"[#{i}] 🟢 Observation(KB) → {len(refs)} chunks\")\n",
    "            elif \"finalResponse\" in obs:\n",
    "                f = obs[\"finalResponse\"].get(\"text\", \"\")\n",
    "                print(f\"[#{i}] 🟣 FinalResponse → {f[:300]}\")\n",
    "        if \"failureTrace\" in t:\n",
    "            print(f\"[#{i}] ❌ Failure → {t['failureTrace'].get('failureReason','')}\")\n",
    "\n",
    "print(\"trace summarizer ready\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "09b459a9",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 8. 步骤 6 · 跑 6 个混合问题\n",
    "\n",
    "| # | 类型 | 问题 |\n",
    "|---|------|------|\n",
    "| 1 | FAQ | 你们日本仓的退货政策是什么？ |\n",
    "| 2 | FAQ | 国际运输大概几天到？ |\n",
    "| 3 | 订单 | 我的订单 #88321 现在到哪了？ |\n",
    "| 4 | 订单+政策 | 订单 #88322 能退货吗？ |\n",
    "| 5 | 多步退货 | 帮我把订单 #88321 退掉 |\n",
    "| 6 | 多步+信息不足 | 我前天买的耳机想换货 |"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "40327f22",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "QUESTIONS = [\n",
    "    (\"FAQ\",          \"你们日本仓的退货政策是什么？\"),\n",
    "    (\"FAQ\",          \"国际运输大概几天到？\"),\n",
    "    (\"订单\",          \"我的订单 #88321 现在到哪了？\"),\n",
    "    (\"订单+政策\",     \"订单 #88322 能退货吗？\"),\n",
    "    (\"多步退货\",      \"帮我把订单 #88321 退掉\"),\n",
    "    (\"信息不足\",      \"我前天买的耳机想换货\"),\n",
    "]\n",
    "\n",
    "results: list[dict] = []\n",
    "for tag, q in QUESTIONS:\n",
    "    print(\"=\"*70)\n",
    "    print(f\"[{tag}] {q}\")\n",
    "    print(\"-\"*70)\n",
    "    try:\n",
    "        ans, tr = invoke_agent_with_trace(q)\n",
    "        summarize_trace(tr)\n",
    "        print(\"\\n📨 最终回答:\")\n",
    "        print(ans)\n",
    "        results.append({\"tag\": tag, \"q\": q, \"answer\": ans, \"trace_count\": len(tr)})\n",
    "    except Exception as e:\n",
    "        print(f\"❌ 调用失败：{e}\")\n",
    "        results.append({\"tag\": tag, \"q\": q, \"answer\": str(e), \"trace_count\": 0})\n",
    "    print()"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "44ee05e1",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 9. 对比表 · 6 题 × Agent 行为分析\n",
    "\n",
    "学员任务：对照上方 trace 输出，把每题观察到的 **Agent 选择路径**填进下表。"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "f7e60677",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# 自动汇总（仅展示 trace 事件数与 answer 摘要；具体路由请人眼对照 trace 摘要）\n",
    "print(f\"{'#':<3}{'类型':<10}{'trace事件':<10}{'回答前 80 字'}\")\n",
    "print(\"-\"*100)\n",
    "for i, r in enumerate(results, 1):\n",
    "    snippet = r[\"answer\"].replace(\"\\n\", \" \")[:80]\n",
    "    print(f\"{i:<3}{r['tag']:<10}{r['trace_count']:<10}{snippet}\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "32dbb106",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "**期望 Agent 行为对照表**（讲师参考答案）：\n",
    "\n",
    "| # | 类型 | 期望 Agent 走法 | 是否对 |\n",
    "|---|------|----------------|-------|\n",
    "| 1 | FAQ | 仅 KB-Lookup | ✅/❌ |\n",
    "| 2 | FAQ | 仅 KB-Lookup | ✅/❌ |\n",
    "| 3 | 订单 | trackShipment（也可先 getOrderStatus） | ✅/❌ |\n",
    "| 4 | 订单+政策 | getOrderStatus → KB-Lookup → 综合 | ✅/❌ |\n",
    "| 5 | 多步退货 | getOrderStatus → KB-Lookup → 给出退货流程 | ✅/❌ |\n",
    "| 6 | 信息不足 | **追问订单号**，不能编造 | ✅/❌ |"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "37d84f4f",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 10. 复盘\n",
    "\n",
    "**1. Agentic RAG vs 传统 RAG**：\n",
    "- 传统 RAG：流程固定（Query → 检索 → 生成），LLM 是\"回答者\"\n",
    "- Agentic RAG：流程动态（规划 → 工具 → 观察），LLM 是\"决策者 + 调度员\"\n",
    "- 客服场景里前者答不了\"我的订单\"，后者必备\n",
    "\n",
    "**2. 写好 Instruction 比写代码更重要**：\n",
    "- 4 段式（角色 / 能力 / **判断规则** / 兜底）缺一不可\n",
    "- 判断规则段落是 Agent 的灵魂；说明书写好了 = Agent 选对工具\n",
    "\n",
    "**3. Schema description 就是在写 Prompt**：\n",
    "- Agent 看不到代码，只看 schema description\n",
    "- description 简略 = Agent 不调或乱调\n",
    "\n",
    "**4. Trace 是 X 光机**：\n",
    "- Rationale = Agent 的\"心声\"\n",
    "- InvocationInput = 选了哪个工具\n",
    "- Observation = 工具返回了什么\n",
    "- 调试 Agent 必看 Trace\n",
    "\n",
    "**5. 上线纪律 5 件**：\n",
    "- 工具粒度（3-7 个为宜）\n",
    "- 错误处理（结构化错误 → Agent 自决降级）\n",
    "- 超时控制（Lambda ≤ 5s，max iterations ≤ 10）\n",
    "- 可观测性（Trace 全程开 + CloudWatch）\n",
    "- 安全护栏（敏感操作二次确认 / Guardrails）"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "d0e85a2a",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 11. 扩展任务（开发背景同学）\n",
    "\n",
    "1. **加第三个工具**：写一个 `createReturn` Lambda + schema，让第 5 题真的能创建退货单（注意：写操作建议加二次确认）。\n",
    "2. **Session Attribute 注入**：把当前登录用户 ID 通过 `sessionState.sessionAttributes` 注入，让 Agent 不用问也能识别用户。\n",
    "3. **多模态扩展**：让用户上传破损商品图，Agent 调用图像分析工具后再走退货流程（结合 Lab 5 多模态）。\n",
    "4. **错误注入**：把 Lambda 改成对 `88323` 返回 `error`，看 Agent 是否会优雅降级（追问 / 转人工）。\n",
    "5. **成本评估**：用 CloudWatch + Trace 估算 6 题平均 token 数 / 每题 LLM 调用次数 / 单题成本，与传统 RAG 对比。\n",
    "6. **Guardrails 联动**（预告 Lab 12）：在 Agent 上挂 Guardrail，测试它是否能在工具返回敏感数据时脱敏。"
   ]
  }
